<title>UK: Norgeskreditt sets $100 mln step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Norgeskreditt sets $100 mln step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated step-up floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns and Yamaichi.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORGESKREDITT ASA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	*3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **21.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    *+30 BP    PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.848    FULL FEES   0.4</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.848</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIVE YEARS, 3ML +105 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		**CALL AFTER FIVE YEARS</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/NORWAY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.2	 SELL CONC   0.2</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
